{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And the chiefs of Judah shall say</b> — their great men who are in the enemy camp." "<b>Strength to me</b> — the prayer of Jerusalem, for they prayed on our behalf a strong prayer. And behold, each one shall say: 'Strength to me for me,' like: 'Say to me: he is my brother.'"], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:50.886748649Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}